  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "testlesson-intro-css-style-70c8962c-8fbd-4a29-89d3-0dced974a0a1",
        "text": "My website is... functional, but a little plain, don't you think?",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/87b1ee2aef553908da9c6a15e748f466-testlesson-intro-css-style-panel-1-a2efa505-b100-4578-ac67-93f0cd85d2d3.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "testlesson-intro-css-style-75e99372-073c-486d-8452-90566ba148de",
        "text": "We can use something called **CSS**, or Cascading Style Sheets, to make it look much better! It helps style web pages.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/471239c8331385667a73b51e7500a3e3-testlesson-intro-css-style-panel-2-fdedbfda-dd9b-4c4e-a7e1-02b61cb42867.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "testlesson-intro-css-style-27e049f2-2247-4a84-8b6f-c7d9cd940d70",
        "text": "CSS lets us change things like text color. Let's make the important headings red to stand out!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/29c42168b85a7b203f9707995afff070-testlesson-intro-css-style-panel-3-c473aa8d-c80b-4bc7-9a3a-96034a63d86b.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "testlesson-intro-css-style-d65297bb-5cd9-410c-ac3f-0f0a1099f1b7",
        "text": "We can also change the background! How about a light blue, reminiscent of the sky Kiki often flies in?",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/0fdad5d385fbe9804aaa727d2f591820-testlesson-intro-css-style-panel-4-322155e5-ccf3-4e4b-969c-d15c959204a7.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "testlesson-intro-css-style-631bb478-4854-46c8-8708-7863d34fc46c",
        "text": "Wow! What a difference! With CSS, my website is looking much more inviting and stylish!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/f51c2fc9ed51dd6578d6f5a2429a4459-testlesson-intro-css-style-panel-5-cf41237f-9229-4ef7-8269-da279653337a.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      }
    ],
    "generate_prompt": "Kiki thinks her website looks a bit plain. Explain that CSS is used to style web pages and make them visually appealing. Show simple examples of how CSS can change text color or background color."
  },
